# Makeshift Binding: "until this enchantment leaves the battlefield" - if the Binding is already gone as its ability resolves, nothing is
# exiled at all (CR 610.3b) but the ability still resolves, so Bot1 still gains 2 life (22). Bot1 destroys its own Binding in response with
# Disenchant (Mox Pearl and Mox Jet) while the ability targets Bot2's Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Makeshift Binding
Disenchant
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

